  "description": {
   "en": "The girl Elna, an adopted daughter of a baron’s family, lived a life full of hardship and mistreatment. But in the midst of her suffering, she suddenly regained memories of her previous life—as the dragon who once protected the kingdom. Carrying the memories of her adventures with the hero she used to fly on her back, she heads to the royal palace, where she meets the young Prince Cross. In that moment, Elna realizes that he is the very same hero—reborn by the hands of fate…",
   "ja": "男爵家の養子である少女エルナは虐げられる日々の中で、自身の前世が国を守護した竜だったことを思い出す。かつて勇者を背に乗せ冒険した記憶を胸に王宮に出向くと、エルナは若き国王クロスと邂逅。その瞬間、エルナは彼が勇者の生まれ変わりだと気付き――。"
  },
